     [ <B>WITH</B> [ <B>LOCAL</B> ] <B>TIME ZONE</B> ]
| <B>INTERVAL YEAR</B> [ (digits) ] <B>TO MONTH</B>

| <B>INTERVAL DAY</B> [ (digits) ] <B>TO SECOND</B>
     [ (digits) ] -- was: fractional_seconds_precision
}</PRE>

