  | <B>INCLUDING</B> column_name 
  | mapping_table_clause
  | <B>PCTTHRESHOLD</B> integer [ segment_attributes_clause ]
  | prefix_compression
  | <B>OVERFLOW</B> [ segment_attributes_clause ]
}...
</PRE>
  
