     | key_compression
     }...
   | ( <B>PARAMETERS</B> string_literal )  --> missing <B>, quoted literal 
   | <B>PARAMETERS</B> (string_literal)   
   ]
]</PRE>
    
    
<PRE object_view_clause>
<B>OF</B> [ schema. ] type_name
{ <B>WITH OBJECT</B> {<B>ID | OID | IDENTIFIER</B>}
